&lt;li&gt;3+ years in Fraud Prevention, Compliance or AML, with at least 1-2 years specifically in a Quality Assurance or Senior Analyst role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge or Excel, SQL and Python is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual fluency in English and Arabic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
